      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i looked at the draft and it definitely sounds better, but i just ran it through our internal scoring tool to see how it would actually perform. \n\nthe coverage score came back at about 0.75. it's okay, but for the top-tier roles we're targeting, we really need that coverage as close to 1.0 as possible. if we don't hit all the keywords, the candidate might still get bumped down the list by the algorithm.\n\ncan you take another pass at it? try to get every single one of those keywords in there so we hit a perfect 1.0 score. just please, please don't make it look like you're just trying to hit a number—it has to stay a professional, cohesive story. just weave them in more effectively.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
